週年，日本各界舉辦哀悼紀念，也分析了引發生態危機的福島核災的昨日與今日。吃壽司、生魚片、和牛及拉麵等食物，會有身在日本的錯覺，自己留學巴黎時就常自己動手作美國加州風味（加avocado)的日式壽司及浸入日式濃縮鰹魚醬油調嗆辣的山葵醬的蕎麥涼麵，感覺清新爽口，現在住臺北，還是常常自己在家作，超級市場內可以買到基本的食材。現在中東戰雲密布，能源危機告急，「作菜，別作戰」是我ㄧ貫祈求世界和平的立場。",null,[0,152]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/312727738602194284/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMnRvYzJSVVVscFZWVW8xWWtSYWIxcHFTa2RoUjNoWFpXMXdNMUpyUlJBQhAB",[null,null,null,"/local/business/312727738602194284/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMnRvYzJSVVVscFZWVW8xWWtSYWIxcHFTa2RoUjNoWFpXMXdNMUpyUlJBQhAB"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/312727738602194284/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMnRvYzJSVVVscFZWVW8xWWtSYWIxcHFTa2RoUjNoWFpXMXdNMUpyUlJBQhAB",[null,null,null,"/local/business/312727738602194284/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMnRvYzJSVVVscFZWVW8xWWtSYWIxcHFTa2RoUjNoWFpXMXdNMUpyUlJBQhAB"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/312727738602194284/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMnRvYzJSVVVscFZWVW8xWWtSYWIxcHFTa2RoUjNoWFpXMXdNMUpyUlJBQhAB",[null,null,null,"/local/business/312727738602194284/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMnRvYzJSVVVscFZWVW8xWWtSYWIxcHFTa2RoUjNoWFpXMXdNMUpyUlJBQhAB"]],[null,null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/@/data\u003d!4m7!23m6!1m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHRjRjlvT2toc2RUUlpVVUo1YkRab1pqSkdhR3hXZW1wM1JrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xdc49ff780673b6fa!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChttcF9oOkhsdTRZUUJ5bDZoZjJGaGxWemp3RkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHRjRjlvT2toc2RUUlpVVUo1YkRab1pqSkdhR3hXZW1wM1JrRRAB\u0026t\u003d3\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHRjRjlvT2toc2RUUlpVVUo1YkRab1pqSkdhR3hXZW1wM1JrRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHRjRjlvT2toc2RUUlpVVUo1YkRab1pqSkdhR3hXZW1wM1JrRRILMGRnTTJDcjJmY0IiEgkAAAAAAAAAABH6tnMGeP9J3CoLMGRnTTJDcjJmY0I\u0026w